{"name":"Endeavour","hex":"#29598b","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"endeavour","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["British standard spelling of endeavor."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["British standard spelling of endeavor."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/endeavour"}],"entries":[{"title":"Endeavour (TV series)","blocks":[{"text":"Endeavour is a British television detective drama series on ITV. It is a prequel to the long-running Inspector Morse series. Shaun Evans portrays the young Endeavour Morse beginning his career as a detective constable, and later as a detective sergeant, with the Oxford City Police CID. Endeavour is the third of the Inspector Morse series, following the original Inspector Morse (1987–2000) and its spin-off, Lewis (2006–2015)."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/7/7b/Endeavour_morse.jpg/330px-Endeavour_morse.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Endeavour_(TV_series)","wikidata":"Q2151914"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/7/7b/Endeavour_morse.jpg/330px-Endeavour_morse.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/7/7b/Endeavour_morse.jpg/330px-Endeavour_morse.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AEndeavour_morse.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bb/Jaguar_2.4_Saloon_%28Mk.1%29_%2816493625592%29.jpg/500px-Jaguar_2.4_Saloon_%28Mk.1%29_%2816493625592%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bb/Jaguar_2.4_Saloon_%28Mk.1%29_%2816493625592%29.jpg/1280px-Jaguar_2.4_Saloon_%28Mk.1%29_%2816493625592%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content